{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03736","headline":"倡妇行 · 李峤","name":"倡妇行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年倡家妇，三秋边地人。\n红妆楼上歇，白发陇头新。\n夜夜风霜苦，年年征戍频。\n山西长落日，塞北久无春。\n团扇辞恩宠，回文赠苦辛。\n胡兵屡攻战，汉使绝和亲。\n消息如瓶井，沈浮似路尘。\n空余千里月，照妾两眉嚬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}